  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Net Zero Mission &#xBF; Sarajevo Functional Urban Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 114, 196);&quot;&gt;Technical support to the Net Zero Mission Sarajevo Functional Urban Area, in preparing, and seeking cross sectoral support through Citizen&#xBF;s Assemblies (CA&#xBF;s), for a Sarajevo Mission Climate City Contract (CCC), in particular the preparation and cross sectoral support through Citizen&#xBF;s Assemblies (CA&#xBF;s) for the City&#xBF;s Climate Neutrality Action Plan (CNAP), as well as supporting Climate Neutrality Investment Plan (CNIP) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
